  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-03-11T19:41:49.267Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When I tried to scale up / down my Avatar in Unity for the different sizes I have of it I noticed that the head collider does seem to not scale correctly. It gets bigger when scaling up and if I scale my avatar down the head collider turns upside down and also starts to get bigger.\nThis behavior seems really strange and prevents me from updating my different sizes, so I hope you can easily fix this.\nHere is a video where you can see what happens: https://youtu.be/O9RmQ9E7TTQ",
